The single source of truth for this project is `AGENTS.md` in the repository root. Read it fully before planning or editing, and follow it.

Do not duplicate or override its rules here.

Hard reminders:
- English only for code, UI and docs.
- Domain, site name and contact email come only from `.env` (`APP_URL`, `SITE_NAME`, `CONTACT_EMAIL`). Never hardcode them.
- AI output is never public until the owner approves it.
- Server has 2 GB RAM: chunk, queue, never load whole tables.
- Before finishing run `composer test`, `vendor/bin/pint --test`, `scripts/check-domain-agnostic.sh`.
